  '{l}: stomatal index {si} % ({n} fields).': '{l}: रंध्र सूचकांक {si} % ({n} क्षेत्र)।',
  '{l}: η = η_water × ρt ÷ (ρ_w t_w) = {e} mPa s.': '{l}: η = η_जल × ρt ÷ (ρ_w t_w) = {e} mPa s।',
  '{metal}: c ≈ {c} J/g °C from {n} readings (tables: {ref}).': '{metal}: {n} रीडिंग से c ≈ {c} J/g °C (सारणी: {ref})।',
  '{mixture}: separated by "{method}".': '{mixture}: "{method}" से अलग हुआ।',
  '{m}: O₂ taken in at {x} mL/min. Now repeat without KOH.': '{m}: O₂ ग्रहण {x} mL/min। अब KOH के बिना दोहराएँ।',
  '{m}: x = {x} mL/min (O₂), y = {y} mL/min (O₂ − CO₂); RQ = (x − y)/x = {rq}, {what}.': '{m}: x = {x} mL/min (O₂), y = {y} mL/min (O₂ − CO₂); RQ = (x − y)/x = {rq}, {what}।',
